# Git LFS: only the TTS cache (rendered speech costs money to regenerate). The bundled pack and its encoded audio
# are build outputs (`make pack`) and are gitignored (docs/02 § Repository layout).
# Run `git lfs install` once before the first commit that adds these files.
content-build/** filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# The mini pack is a few KB and Linux CI checks out without LFS, so it stays a plain (binary) Git file.
fixtures/packs/*.sqlite binary
